OL,3,AAt least two dead in blast at Bolivia
OL,4,Amilitary barracks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least two people have been killed
OL,7,Fafter an explosion at a military
OL,8,Fbarracks in Bolivia - but authorities
OL,9,Ffear the toll could be higher.
OL,11,FBolivian Defence Minister Ernesto
OL,12,FJustiniano said at least 81 people had
OL,13,Fbeen injured when "pyrotechnic
OL,14,Fmaterial" detonated at the barracks,
OL,15,Fwhere an artillery regiment was
OL,16,Fstationed, about 14:30 local time
OL,17,F(18:30 GMT) on Friday. Seven others
OL,18,Fremain missing.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
